{"title":"2021 Fall AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems#Problem_8\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems\">2021 Fall AMC 10B #8</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems#Problem_6\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12B Problems\">2021 Fall AMC 12B #6</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Just_1_min!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Just 1 min!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The greatest prime number that is a divisor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef62617df2b523b78abba9c6ee16a87eed666d9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16{,}384$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/66013f9e66e9773cf2a443199d601cbea43f908b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16{,}384 = 2^{14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" />. What is the sum of the digits of the greatest prime number that is a divisor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/1/e312856f4accd5c9db240a860ea3f8af37a69b98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16{,}383$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/c/31c6ead2cedd485627f966d38b24d63d22511909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\: 3\\qquad\\textbf{(B)} \\: 7\\qquad\\textbf{(C)} \\: 10\\qquad\\textbf{(D)} \\: 16\\qquad\\textbf{(E)} \\: 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"371\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324c59bba657f02ba72c2377e953381eaec85cd8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 16383 &amp; = 2^{14} - 1 \\\\ &amp; = \\left( 2^7 + 1 \\right) \\left( 2^7 - 1 \\right) \\\\ &amp; = 129 \\cdot 127 \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"196\" height=\"70\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/7/657b97a497d22369149bd9dc22e0d35eb5dda31c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$129$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> is composite, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5aff9f43a5b6838a7ae07cb73c81ce4ac4304f5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$127$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> is the largest prime which can divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/e/a2e54c98ae1ed12d20221e33c5c7c9731e417761.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16383$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5aff9f43a5b6838a7ae07cb73c81ce4ac4304f5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$127$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />'s digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/4/6d4a71709998fe92fb483fea907ecb4b53968324.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+7=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"162\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (www.professorchenedu.com) ~NH14 ~kingofpineapplz ~Arcticturn ~MrThinker ~abed_nadir(youtube.com/@indianmathguy)\n~PaperMath\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Note that you can quickly tell that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88d7581f0d2cde217dad169609064c775d9ff7bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^7 -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> is prime because it is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mersenne_prime\" title=\"Mersenne prime\">Mersenne prime</a>.\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:South\">South</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/p9_RH4s-kBA?t=1121\">https://youtu.be/p9_RH4s-kBA?t=1121</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Just_1_min.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Just_1_min!)\">Video Solution (Just 1 min!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Just 1 min!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/NB6CamKgDaw\">https://youtu.be/NB6CamKgDaw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/JBNbjKsw_tU\">https://youtu.be/JBNbjKsw_tU</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For AMC 10: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RyN-fKNtd3A&amp;t=797\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RyN-fKNtd3A&amp;t=797</a>\n</p><p>For AMC 12: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4qgYrCYG-qw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4qgYrCYG-qw</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B\">2021 Fall AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofpr